 thought the project was \"weird\" but took the job for the $5,000 fee. Y’s weathered, aged face became the perfect \"object\" for X’s study of existence. Id X and Y.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:36:16Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Beckett", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:36:25Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Waah", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:36:27Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Peter sellera", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:36:27Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "keaton", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:36:29Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "buster ‎", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:36:30Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Samuel Becketts is X", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:36:39Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "What a question bc", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:36:44Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Bustor Keaton is Y", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:36:45Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Lovely question", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:36:50Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Lovely trivia", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:37:00Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Manas 10, Sa